---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  metadata={{
    title: 'Privacy Policy',
    robots: { index: false, follow: false },
  }}
>
  <div class="container-site py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-sm prose-headings:text-navy">
      <p><em>Last updated: June 2026</em></p>
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide when you contact us through our website forms, including your name, email address, company name, and product inquiry details.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information to respond to your inquiries, provide quotations, and communicate with you about our manufacturing services.</p>
      <h2>Data Protection</h2>
      <p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information. We do not sell or share your data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>To request deletion or correction of your data, email <a href="mailto:sales@charlizi.com" class="text-accent">sales@charlizi.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
